 "method": "Extracted from the publication PDFs with pdftotext -layout. A page is the number printed in the page footer (AI 100-1 'Page N'; AI 600-1 the bare footer number), not the PDF viewer index. A subcategory's page is where its identifier starts in Tables 1 to 4; an action's page is where its Action ID is printed. AI 600-1 lists actions for only some subcategories. It prints GV-4.3-001 as 'GV4.3--001' (recorded under printed_as); GV-1.1-002 appears only in the explanatory text as an example and is not an action.",
